ithub.com/users/LNXSeus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/x-zip-compressed","state":"uploaded","size":132556690,"digest":"sha256:877367f17b2ada8955bca296dfadf1c9c79091caa09d3d1d5e36cabc14a8c959","download_count":58,"created_at":"2026-09-22T20:26:53Z","updated_at":"2026-09-22T20:27:43Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/LNXSeus/Advancely/releases/download/v1.7.2/Advancely-v1.7.2-Windows.zip"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LNXSeus/Advancely/tarball/v1.7.2","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LNXSeus/Advancely/zipball/v1.7.2","body":"## Had to get this hotfix out as soon as I noticed the overlay width setting being broken again. There are some new features, but not as many as I wanted to put into this release.\r\n\r\n- Added an option for descriptions to to every main goal type, that when used, adds a hover text to the goal that can display explanatory info. It has a 1024 character limit.\r\n- The run completion criteria got moved from the settings into the template itself. There's now a new `Run Completion` tab when editing a template, that drives both completion and the progress text.\r\n- Updated the `1.16` `all_blocks` template to complete when all blocks have been placed using the new run completion features.\r\n- Stages of a multi-stage goal, that are set to the type `Stat`, have a new setting to start counting from 0 the moment that stage is reached.\r\n- Stages can now also mirror another goal.\r\n- The compact overlay panel can now have its text chained to display it all at once. The limit is 32. This allows to see progress of multiple goals at once without flipping through pages. The entries follow the selection order.\r\n- Added a hotkey to toggle the selection rectangle: `Shift + S`. Also toggleable through the `View` button.\r\n- Criteria groups now get drawn as one goal.\r\n- If sub-icons share the same icon AND parent icon the redundant shared icon is hidden. A new setting allows to enable it either way.\r\n- Added new `cmplx`/`complex` tag to the template editor and tracker search that allows filtering specifically for advancements/achievements or recipes with criteria.\r\n- Added a clear animation for frozen rows so items smoothly animate back cover the empty slot that cleared.\r\n- Fixed language file key propagation after language import or rename.\r\n- Removed a duplicate oak slab texture.\r\n\r\n### Fixes\r\n- Fixed linked-goal popup range selection selecting items out of order.\r\n- Fixed manual custom goals pushing auto-arranged goals aside.\r\n- Fixed applying settings resetting stat checkboxes when no world is being tracked.\r\n\r\n### Documentation\r\n- Added documentation about text-sharpness guidance. Zoom at exactly 1.0, text size at 16.\r\n- Added self-link warning for linked goals.\r\n\r\n### Versions/Templates\r\n- Added minecraft version 27.1 already.\r\n- `1.0` `test1`, `1.16.1` `test1` and `craftmine` `test1` templates updated.\r\n\r\n-----\r\n\r\n> Find more info on the [tracker main page](https://github.com/LNXSeus/Advancely)!\r\n\r\n-----\r\n\r\n## *[Donations](https://streamlabs.com/lnxseus/tip) are always welcome\\! Make sure to mention `Advancely` in the donation message.*\r\n\r\nEnjoy the update\\!"}